Subject: [PATCH 20/21] SelectionEvidence: unit test, and its header follows
 the binder

tests/selection-evidence.test.js runs the pass on a hand-built ledger and
player (no replay): a trained unit gets its handle and listed death, an
unlisted one is flagged, a typed mercenary handle nobody took is added and an
enemy unit clicked on alone is not.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
